"一、服务说明","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-s1-p","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#334155","mode":"plaintext","text":"本条款适用于你使用本平台提供的建站、内容管理与发布服务。使用本服务即表示你已阅读并同意本条款。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-d1","type":"core.divider","props":{}},{"id":"policy-s2","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"二、账号与使用规范","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-s2-p","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#334155","mode":"plaintext","text":"你应对账号下的全部操作负责，不得将账号转借他人。禁止利用本服务发布违法、侵权或误导性内容，不得进行任何影响服务稳定性的行为。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-d2","type":"core.divider","props":{}},{"id":"policy-s3","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"三、隐私与数据保护","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-s3-p","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#334155","mode":"plaintext","text":"我们仅收集提供服务所必需的信息，访问统计使用匿名化的派生标识，不用于识别自然人。未经你的同意，我们不会向第三方出售你的数据。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-d3","type":"core.divider","props":{}},{"id":"policy-s4","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"四、内容规范","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-s4-p","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#334155","mode":"plaintext","text":"你对自己上传的文字、图片与视频拥有全部权利，并保证不侵犯任何第三方权益。我们有权对明显违规的内容进行下架处理。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-d4","type":"core.divider","props":{}},{"id":"policy-s5","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"五、免责声明","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-s5-p","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#334155","mode":"plaintext","text":"因不可抗力、第三方服务中断或你自身配置错误导致的服务不可用，我们不承担由此产生的间接损失。建议在发布前使用预览功能核对效果。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-d5","type":"core.divider","props":{}},{"id":"policy-s6","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"六、条款变更","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"policy-s6-p","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#334155","mode":"plaintext","text":"条款如需变更，我们会在本页面更新并标注生效日期。继续使用服务即视为接受变更后的条款。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}}]},{"id":"policy-contact","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"56px 24px","mobile":"40px 16px"}},"layout":{"engine":"flex","flex":{"direction":"column","gap":"16px"}},"tag":"section","visual":{"bgColor":"#f8fafc"}},"children":[{"id":"policy-contact-title","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"对条款有疑问？","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"center"},"tablet":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"center"},"mobile":{"fontSize":"24px","textAlign":"center"}}}},{"id":"policy-contact-desc","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#475569","mode":"plaintext","text":"欢迎通过邮件或留言表单与我们沟通。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"},"tablet":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"},"mobile":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"}}}},{"id":"policy-contact-actions","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"8px 0 0","mobile":"8px 0 0"}},"layout":{"engine":"grid","grid":{"columnGap":"16px","columns":{"desktop":1,"mobile":1,"tablet":1},"rowGap":"16px"}},"tag":"div"},"children":[{"id":"policy-contact-btn","type":"core.button","props":{"action":"internal","bg":"#2563eb","size":"lg","text":"联系我们","textColor":"#ffffff","value":"/contact"}}]}]}]}'::jsonb, now()),
