     '{"settings":{"layout":{"mode":"boxed","maxWidth":"1000px"},"seo":{"title":"常见问题","description":"关于账号、内容、发布与计费的常见问题解答。","schemaType":"faq"}},"root":[{"id":"faq-head","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"72px 24px","mobile":"48px 16px"}},"layout":{"engine":"flex","flex":{"direction":"column","gap":"16px"}},"tag":"section","visual":{"bgColor":"#0f172a"}},"children":[{"id":"faq-head-title","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#ffffff","tag":"h1","text":"常见问题","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"40px","textAlign":"center"},"tablet":{"fontSize":"40px","textAlign":"center"},"mobile":{"fontSize":"40px","textAlign":"center"}}}},{"id":"faq-head-desc","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#cbd5e1","mode":"plaintext","text":"先看看这里有没有你要的答案。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"},"tablet":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"},"mobile":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"}}}}]},{"id":"faq-general","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"56px 24px","mobile":"36px 16px"}},"layout":{"engine":"flex","flex":{"direction":"column","gap":"16px"}},"tag":"section","visual":{}},"children":[{"id":"faq-general-title","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"账号与使用","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"26px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"faq-general-list","type":"core.faq","props":{"items":[{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e进入控制台后点击「新建站点」，填写站点名称与默认语言即可。系统会自动准备一套默认主题与首页蓝图，你可以在画布上直接修改。\u003c/p\u003e","open":true,"question":"如何创建一个新站点？"},{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e在登录页点击「忘记密码」，通过注册邮箱重置。若邮箱已不可用，请联系管理员在后台重置密码。\u003c/p\u003e","question":"忘记密码怎么办？"},{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e可以。在「管理员与角色」中创建账号并分配角色，权限按接口粒度控制，可以只给内容编辑权限而不给发布权限。\u003c/p\u003e","question":"可以邀请团队成员协作吗？"}]}}]},{"id":"faq-content","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"56px 24px","mobile":"36px 16px"}},"layout":{"engine":"flex","flex":{"direction":"column","gap":"16px"}},"tag":"section","visual":{"bgColor":"#f8fafc"}},"children":[{"id":"faq-content-title","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"内容与页面","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"26px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"faq-content-list","type":"core.faq","props":{"items":[{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e蓝图只用于初始化页面文档，复制完成后就与蓝图再无关系；内容结构模板每次构建都会参与，改动会传播到使用它的实例。\u003c/p\u003e","open":true,"question":"蓝图和模板有什么区别？"},{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e多数情况下不需要。发布时会重新构建产物；如果只改了主题或组件版本，系统会把相关页面标记为待重建。\u003c/p\u003e","question":"页面改动后需要手动重建吗？"},{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e可以。先在站点设置里启用语言，再为每种语言维护对应的译文，发布时会为每种语言生成独立的静态产物。\u003c/p\u003e","question":"可以给页面做多语言吗？"},{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e支持。正文编辑器保留了标题层级、表格、折叠块与水平线，服务端会按白名单清洗后输出。\u003c/p\u003e","question":"文章正文支持表格和折叠块吗？"}]}}]},{"id":"faq-publish","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"56px 24px","mobile":"36px 16px"}},"layout":{"engine":"flex","flex":{"direction":"column","gap":"16px"}},"tag":"section","visual":{}},"children":[{"id":"faq-publish-title","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"发布与访问","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"26px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"faq-publish-list","type":"core.faq","props":{"items":[{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e构建通常在数秒内完成，完成后访问路径立即指向新的静态产物。\u003c/p\u003e","open":true,"question":"发布后多久生效？"},{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e可以。每次发布都会保留不可变的产物版本，在发布记录里选择任一版本即可回滚。\u003c/p\u003e","question":"发布错了可以回滚吗？"},{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e不会。访客访问的是已经激活的静态文件，渲染与数据查询都发生在发布阶段。\u003c/p\u003e","question":"访客访问会查询数据库吗？"}]}}]},{"id":"faq-billing","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"56px 24px","mobile":"36px 16px"}},"layout":{"engine":"flex","flex":{"direction":"column","gap":"16px"}},"tag":"section","visual":{"bgColor":"#f8fafc"}},"children":[{"id":"faq-billing-title","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#0f172a","tag":"h2","text":"计费与支持","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"26px","textAlign":"left"},"tablet":{},"mobile":{}}}},{"id":"faq-billing-list","type":"core.faq","props":{"items":[{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e按超出部分的实际访问量结算，账单在次月生成，可在控制台查看明细。\u003c/p\u003e","open":true,"question":"超出套餐的访问量怎么计费？"},{"answer":"\u003cp\u003e提供工单与邮件支持，工作时间内响应；企业版可约定专属响应时间。\u003c/p\u003e","question":"有技术支持吗？"}]}}]},{"id":"faq-cta","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"56px 24px","mobile":"40px 16px"}},"layout":{"engine":"flex","flex":{"direction":"column","gap":"16px"}},"tag":"section","visual":{"bgColor":"#0f172a"}},"children":[{"id":"faq-cta-title","type":"core.heading","props":{"color":"#ffffff","tag":"h2","text":"没有找到答案？","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"28px","textAlign":"center"},"tablet":{"fontSize":"28px","textAlign":"center"},"mobile":{"fontSize":"28px","textAlign":"center"}}}},{"id":"faq-cta-desc","type":"core.text","props":{"color":"#cbd5e1","mode":"plaintext","text":"把你的问题发给我们，我们会尽快回复。","typography":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"},"tablet":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"},"mobile":{"fontSize":"16px","textAlign":"center"}}}},{"id":"faq-cta-actions","type":"core.container","props":{"box":{"padding":{"desktop":"8px 0 0","mobile":"8px 0 0"}},"layout":{"engine":"grid","grid":{"columnGap":"16px","columns":{"desktop":1,"mobile":1,"tablet":1},"rowGap":"16px"}},"tag":"div"},"children":[{"id":"faq-cta-btn","type":"core.button","props":{"action":"internal","bg":"#2563eb","size":"lg","text":"提交问题","textColor":"#ffffff","value":"/contact"}}]}]}]}'::jsonb, now())

